Export the licence text

The archive ships its licence as LICENSE.txt, which the BUILD file leaves out
of its exported files, so no licence declaration can point at it.

--- a/BUILD.bazel
+++ b/BUILD.bazel
@@ -2,6 +2,7 @@
     ".clippy.toml",
     ".rustfmt.toml",
     "LICENSE",
+    "LICENSE.txt",
     "MODULE.bazel",
     "version.bzl",
 ])
